{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2023-03-24 21:00:00', 'title': 'DISH ALERT: BRAGAR EAGEL & SQUIRE, P.C. ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST DISH NETWORK CORPORATION AND ENCOURAGES INVESTORS TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #A--BRAGAR EAGEL & SQUIRE, P.C., A NATIONALLY RECOGNIZED STOCKHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST DISH NETWORK CORPORATION (“DISH” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: DISH) IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE DISTRICT OF COLORADO ON BEHALF OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED DISH SECURITIES BETWEEN FEBRUARY 22, 2021 AND FEBRUARY 27, 2023, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”).'}{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2023-03-24 19:11:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: ROBBINS LLP INFORMS INVESTORS OF CLASS ACTION AGAINST DISH NETWORK CORPORATION (DISH)', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $DISH #CYBERSECURITY--DISH NETWORK CORPORATION (DISH) MADE FALSE AND MISLEADING STATEMENTS REGARDING ITS CYBERSECURITY AND INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY INFRASTRUCTURE'}{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2023-03-24 09:30:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ACTION REMINDER: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN DISH NETWORK CORPORATION WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $DISH #DISH--THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN DISH NETWORK CORPORATION WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM'}{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2023-03-24 09:17:00', 'title': 'EQUITY ALERT: ROSEN, A GLOBALLY RECOGNIZED LAW FIRM, ENCOURAGES DISH NETWORK CORPORATION INVESTORS WITH LOSSES IN EXCESS OF $100K TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION – DISH', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF DISH NETWORK CORPORATION (NASDAQ: DISH) BETWEEN FEBRUARY 22, 2021 AND FEBRUARY 27, 2023, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”). A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS ALREADY BEEN FILED. IF YOU WISH TO SERVE AS LEAD PLAINTIFF, YOU MUST MOVE THE COURT NO LATER THAN MAY 22, 2023.'}